  "text": "a fireworks game where the night sky sits dark and quiet until I tap it, and each tap sends a rocket climbing up to burst into a spray of stars that keeps glittering there; my burst count goes up by one for every rocket I send up, and a big finale button sets the whole sky off at once. With ?test=1 in the address, every duration is at most 2 seconds.",
